@host = http://localhost:5165

### Gateway status
GET {{host}}/

### All registered devices
GET {{host}}/api/devices

### Filtered devices
GET {{host}}/api/devices?deviceType=Temperature&isActive=true

### The location hierarchy
GET {{host}}/api/locations

### Recursive location validation (valid leaf)
GET {{host}}/api/locations/validate/SH-JHB-01A

### Recursive location validation (exists but is a grouping level)
GET {{host}}/api/locations/validate/DEP-JHB

### Recursive location validation (does not exist)
GET {{host}}/api/locations/validate/SH-CPT-99Z

### Register a device
POST {{host}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "TMP-006",
  "deviceName": "PTA Shelf B Probe",
  "deviceType": "Temperature",
  "locationCode": "SH-PTA-01B",
  "isActive": true
}

### Registration that fails every rule
POST {{host}}/api/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "nope",
  "deviceName": "X",
  "deviceType": "Toaster",
  "locationCode": "SH-MARS-01A",
  "isActive": true
}

### Mixed telemetry (look at the valueType column: Double, Int32, Boolean)
GET {{host}}/api/telemetry?take=30

### Anomalous telemetry only
GET {{host}}/api/telemetry?onlyAnomalies=true&take=30

### The jagged monitoring-zone array
GET {{host}}/api/telemetry/zones

### Zone average, produced by the overloaded + operator
GET {{host}}/api/telemetry/zones/0/average-temperature

### Outstanding anomalies
GET {{host}}/api/anomalies?acknowledged=false

### Acknowledge anomaly 1
POST {{host}}/api/anomalies/1/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operatorName": "S. Operator",
  "note": "Door was left open during a stock take. Closed and verified temperature recovery."
}
